<Slide style={{ padding: '22px 64px 18px 64px', background: '#F7F4EC' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 102, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>换引擎：14 个里挑一个干活</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.72)', marginTop: 6 }}>点左下角引擎名展开清单。不换也行 —— 本机默认的 OMP Engine 已经就绪</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ padding: '10px 18px', background: '#1D1B16', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B8730F' }}>零基础可以跳过本页</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 534, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700, height: 534, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Image src="assets/03_engine.png" style={{ width: 700, height: 446, borderRadius: 11, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)' }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 430, height: 534, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 15 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 168, padding: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>① 绿点 = 能跑</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 9 }}>每个引擎后面标着自己的定位：实时引擎、原生运行浏览、零成本演练。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 168, padding: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>② 灰点 = 本机没装</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 9 }}>灰色并标注"离线"。选了也跑不起来，所以直接用绿点的就行。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 168, padding: 18, background: 'rgba(184,115,15,0.10)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(184,115,15,0.42)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8A5608' }}>③ 换引擎不影响历史</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.80)', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 9 }}>每次运行都会记下自己的引擎，账本上会打 MOCK / OMP 徽标。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.48)' }}>第一次建议保持默认，不要动这里</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.48)' }}>14 / 34</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
